msgstr "Mulai dari sini"

#: ../../index.md:24 4b0c87d0aa3f46b090d14298e40bb99f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{doc}`site-reference/index` — what the platform consists of, area by "
"area, plus a generated inventory of every route, game and app."
msgstr ""
"{doc}`site-reference/index` — apa saja yang membentuk platform ini, area "
"demi area, ditambah inventaris yang dihasilkan otomatis untuk setiap "
"rute, game, dan aplikasi."

#: ../../index.md:26 bfcf4e6e39b249368063d755651dd805
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{doc}`developer-api/index` — the public REST API: guides and a generated "
"endpoint reference."
msgstr ""
"{doc}`developer-api/index` — REST API publik: panduan dan referensi "
"endpoint yang dihasilkan otomatis."

#: ../../index.md:28 443b6aa82673403e90e7f484159c2cc3
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{doc}`codebase-overview` — canonical code-layout overview: stack, repo "
"layout, conventions, and where to look first."
msgstr ""
"{doc}`codebase-overview` — gambaran tata letak kode yang baku: stack, "
"tata letak repositori, konvensi, dan tempat pertama untuk mulai melihat."

#: ../../index.md:30 02760732a983427ba5c7c830715293aa
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{doc}`architecture` — runtime topology and the deploy pipeline: what runs"
" where in production, images, CI, ports, auth across tiers."
msgstr ""
"{doc}`architecture` — topologi runtime dan pipeline deploy: apa yang "
"berjalan di mana pada produksi, image, CI, port, autentikasi lintas "
"tier."

#: ../../index.md:32 dc750e01738c4729b28ba6e7f77e5604
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{doc}`design-language` — the visual system (**Radial Avant-Garde "
"Glass**): the `--site-*` token contract, themes, primitives, motion, "
"accessibility."
msgstr ""
"{doc}`design-language` — sistem visual (**Radial Avant-Garde Glass**): "
"kontrak token `--site-*`, tema, primitif, gerakan, aksesibilitas."

#: ../../index.md:34 5a975a7d5c2d4e219782a07426192ce9
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{doc}`testing` — the test suites (Vitest main + epic, Go Bazel) and which"
" CI workflows gate them."
msgstr ""
"{doc}`testing` — rangkaian pengujian (Vitest utama + epic, Go Bazel) dan "
"alur kerja CI mana yang menjadi gerbangnya."

#: ../../index.md:36 a746af2827ff44d19ffc73b066853bb8
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{doc}`README` — the full annotated map of `docs/`, including freshness "
"flags for every directory."
msgstr ""
"{doc}`README` — peta lengkap beranotasi dari `docs/`, termasuk penanda "
"kesegaran untuk setiap direktori."

#: ../../index.md:39 a8d93fb8f6be4d0d8bb0a60c61154e5e
msgid "Trust order for conflicting information"
msgstr "Urutan kepercayaan untuk informasi yang saling bertentangan"

#: ../../index.md:41 cff4b228f55148298403b9ffc2a3c086
msgid ""
"Code > `docker-compose.yml` + `deploy.sh` (runtime truth) > root "
"`CLAUDE.md` and the per-directory `CLAUDE.md` files > the reference docs "
"below > dated design docs and plans. Those dated documents are historical"
" snapshots: they describe intent at the time of writing, not necessarily "
"the current code. Anything claiming Next.js or PM2 is out of date."
msgstr ""
"Kode > `docker-compose.yml` + `deploy.sh` (kebenaran runtime) > "
"`CLAUDE.md` di root dan berkas `CLAUDE.md` per direktori > dokumen "
"referensi di bawah > dokumen desain dan rencana bertanggal. Dokumen "
"bertanggal tersebut adalah cuplikan historis: menggambarkan maksud pada "
"saat penulisan, bukan berarti kode saat ini. Apa pun yang menyatakan "
"Next.js atau PM2 sudah usang."

